</element-citation></ref><ref id="b0050"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other" id="h0050">European Reference Networks. von-Hippel Lindau disease (vHL). Last update: September 2023. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://www.genturis.eu/l=eng/Thematic-disease-groups/Other-rare-genturis/von-Hippel-Lindau-disease.html" id="ir015">https://www.genturis.eu/l=eng/Thematic-disease-groups/Other-rare-genturis/von-Hippel-Lindau-disease.html</ext-link>.</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b0055"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal" id="h0055"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maher</surname><given-names>E.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Neumann</surname><given-names>H.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Richard</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>von Hippel-Lindau disease: a clinical and scientific review</article-title><source>Eur J Hum Genet</source><volume>19</volume><year>2011</year><fpage>617</fpage><lpage>623</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21386872</pub-id>
